{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261115/photo/bkn-20261115163555844-1115_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261115171939\"/><p>案發貴輝樓一單位。</p><p>今日(15日)上午11時55分，牛頭角下邨貴輝樓一單位，一名姓賴(41歲)女住戶報案，指失去一批約值50萬港元的金器、及31萬元現金，當中包括23萬港元、日圓、韓圜和人民幣。警員到場經初步調查，案件列作「盜竊」跟進，暫未有人被捕。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T09:38:50.377577+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T08:35:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T13:55:29.918621+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T09:32:28.214495+00:00","content_hash":"ce07b02a42acd72163ee8c79d57f9e1436a0a844b168f85adab17e33329e74d8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}